  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bua Rice Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Rice.Beneficiaries: 212 Members.Description: Bua Producers and Marketing Cooperative Society Limited is a rice producing farmer cooperative based in Nkhotakhota. The USADF grant will fund quality inputs, crop purchases, training in rice irrigation scheme maintenance, purchase of power tillers, improvement its financial and human resource management and the infrastructure improvements needed for Bua to meet the requirements of the Malawi Bureau of Standards.</narrative>
  </description>
